      "costUsd": 0.005948500000000001,
      "pronunciationText": "From six to eight, the graph is below the axis. Every strip there is negative, or zero at the start, so no sum is positive, and the integral can't be positive either. This region has real size below the axis, so here the integral is negative. This triangle has base two and depth four, so its area is four. So the integral from six to eight is minus four. The bath loses four litres."
